# Shape — environment variables
#
# Shape is a key-in-localStorage app: drafts live in the browser and export
# to JSON / PDF. No env required for the playgrounds, studio, or notebook to
# work locally.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Linear feedback (POST /api/feedback). When both vars below are set, the
# floating "Feedback" button in the bottom-right files a ticket in Linear.
# Without them the endpoint returns 503 and the modal shows a clear
# "not configured" message — local dev still works.

# Personal API key — Linear settings → API → Personal API keys. Keep secret;
# this is server-side only, never exposed to the browser.
LINEAR_API_KEY=

# UUID of the team the feedback tickets should land in. Find via Linear
# settings → API, or run a `teams { nodes { id name } }` query.
LINEAR_TEAM_ID=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Canonical site origin, used for metadata absolute URLs AND as the
# allow-list for the same-origin guard on /api/feedback and /api/proxy/openai.
# On Vercel, the deployment's own host plus *.shape-models.com are already
# allowed; set this only if you serve from a different custom domain, so its
# own pages aren't blocked by the guard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hosted free tier (POST /api/hosted/anthropic). Lets visitors without an API
# key run Claude Haiku 4.5 on Shape's key, within a daily allowance and a
# hard monthly spend cap. Off unless SHAPE_FREE_TIER=on AND every required
# var below is set. Quota counters live in Supabase (see
# supabase/migrations/*_free_tier_quota.sql). If Supabase is unreachable the
# free tier refuses calls rather than serving them uncounted.

# The off switch. Anything other than "on" hides the free tier everywhere.
SHAPE_FREE_TIER=

# A dedicated Anthropic key for the free tier, so it can be revoked or
# spend-limited in the Anthropic console without touching anything else.
HOSTED_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Hard ceiling on free-tier spend per calendar month (UTC), in US dollars.
HOSTED_MONTHLY_CAP_USD=

# Optional. Calls per visitor per day (default 50) and per network per day
# (default 1500 — a classroom or office shares one IP).
HOSTED_DAILY_CALLS=
HOSTED_NETWORK_DAILY_CALLS=

# Random string used to hash visitor ids and IPs before they're stored.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
QUOTA_HASH_SECRET=

# Supabase project URL and its secret (service role) key. Server-side only.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sharing (POST /api/share, pages at /e/<slug>). Publishes a lab experiment —
# design, answers, manifest — as an unlisted, read-only link. Uses the same
# Supabase project and QUOTA_HASH_SECRET as the free tier (set those above).
# Schema: supabase/migrations/*_shared_experiments.sql.
#
# To take a shared page down yourself, delete its row from
# public.shared_experiments in the Supabase dashboard.

# The off switch. Anything other than "on" hides the Share panel.
SHAPE_SHARING=

# Optional. Publishes per network per day (default 20).
SHARE_DAILY_LIMIT=
